{"title":"gitlab_sec","url":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/categories/security/","favicon":"https://about.gitlab.com/images/ico/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"GitLab Orbit: Find vulnerability blast radius without the manual hunt","contents":"<div class=\"image\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><img data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" fetch-priority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1780996524/sd1vpl8empy26wizarqj.png\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\">Featured post</h2><div class=\"text\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading4-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Orbit: Find vulnerability blast radius without the manual hunt<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-heading5\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><!--[-->Exploitation happens at machine speed now. Map every project, owner, and pipeline a critical CVE touches so remediation can keep up.<!--]--><!----></p><span class=\"slp-text-body3-bold author\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><!--[-->Author: Rebecca Carter<!--]--><!----></span><a class=\"cta slp-mt-16 slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta slp-mt-16\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab orbit: find vulnerability blast radius without the manual hunt\" data-ga-location=\"body\" href=\"/blog/find-vulnerability-blast-radius-with-gitlab-orbit/\" data-v-c6fd7cb9=\"\" data-v-adbaae8b=\"\"><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/find-vulnerability-blast-radius-with-gitlab-orbit/","retrieved":1794880429966},{"title":"What happens when vulnerabilities are discovered faster than you can fix them?","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/security-at-machine-speed/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"what happens when vulnerabilities are discovered faster than you can fix them?\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1772195014/ooezwusxjl1f7ijfmbvj.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->What happens when vulnerabilities are discovered faster than you can fix them?<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Frontier AI is changing how quickly vulnerabilities can be discovered and exploited. The next challenge is bringing that same speed to remediation and prevention, inside the software factory.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/security-at-machine-speed/","retrieved":1794880429967},{"title":"Uncover the business logic vulnerabilities SAST scanners miss","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-business-logic-security-analyzer/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"uncover the business logic vulnerabilities sast scanners miss\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Uncover the business logic vulnerabilities SAST scanners miss<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Now in early access, Business Logic Security Analyzer reads your repository, infers what each endpoint should enforce, and flags the gaps.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-business-logic-security-analyzer/","retrieved":1794880429968},{"title":"AI Governance: One view of agent activity","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/ai-governance-dashboard/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"ai governance: one view of agent activity\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773860699/gf9bdnis6ggrn4huvfrl.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1773860699/gf9bdnis6ggrn4huvfrl.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773860699/gf9bdnis6ggrn4huvfrl.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->AI Governance: One view of agent activity<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->See AI agent activity in one place with the GitLab AI Governance Dashboard, across Duo Agent Platform and the externally connected agents your developers use.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/ai-governance-dashboard/","retrieved":1794880429969},{"title":"Building AI security in the open","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/gitlab-joins-open-secure-ai-alliance/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"building ai security in the open\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1773866173/vte9qh8rriznvyclhkes.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Building AI security in the open<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab has joined the Open Secure AI Alliance to help advance transparent, adaptable approaches to securing AI systems.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/gitlab-joins-open-secure-ai-alliance/","retrieved":1794880429970},{"title":"GitLab Secrets Manager: Govern secrets like your code","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/secrets-manager-ga/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"gitlab secrets manager: govern secrets like your code\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1791993648/t2kod74bclspits5cc5o.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1791993648/t2kod74bclspits5cc5o.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1791993648/t2kod74bclspits5cc5o.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Secrets Manager: Govern secrets like your code<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Tighten credential security by scoping build-time secrets to the jobs that need them and serving runtime secrets from the same store. Generally available in GitLab 19.5.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/secrets-manager-ga/","retrieved":1794880429971},{"title":"Track organization-wide security risk in one dashboard","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/security-risk-in-one-dashboard/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"track organization-wide security risk in one dashboard\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756122536/akivvcnafog9c4dhhzkp.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Track organization-wide security risk in one dashboard<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->For enterprises with many top-level groups, GitLab now aggregates vulnerabilities and a single risk score across your entire organization.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/security-risk-in-one-dashboard/","retrieved":1791477827191},{"title":"Dependency Firewall: Block risky packages before the build","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/transcend-dependency-firewall/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"dependency firewall: block risky packages before the build\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1791198675/kmajkudog4fj3xc6qfyb.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1791198675/kmajkudog4fj3xc6qfyb.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1791198675/kmajkudog4fj3xc6qfyb.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Dependency Firewall: Block risky packages before the build<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->GitLab Dependency Firewall helps keep malicious and vulnerable packages out of your build automatically, so teams and their agents ship fast with trusted dependencies.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/transcend-dependency-firewall/","retrieved":1791307317750},{"title":"Securing the software factory at machine speed","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/securing-the-software-factory-at-machine-speed/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"securing the software factory at machine speed\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1759320418/xjmqcozxzt4frx0hori3.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Securing the software factory at machine speed<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->The foundation for agentic software development must evolve with AI models, continuously shortening the path from detection to verified remediation.<!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/securing-the-software-factory-at-machine-speed/","retrieved":1789771483130},{"title":"When to use SAST versus an LLM security scanner","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/categories/security/\" data-ga-name=\"security\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><span class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->Security<!--]--><!----></span></a><a href=\"/blog/sast-vs-llm-security-scanner/\" class=\"card-body\" data-ga-name=\"when to use sast versus an llm security scanner\" data-ga-location=\"post-card\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><img width=\"318\" data-nuxt-img=\"\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_636,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png 2x\" onerror=\"this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_318,c_lfill/v1756989645/fojzxakmfdea6jfqjkrl.png\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><h3 class=\"slp-text-heading5-bold\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->When to use SAST versus an LLM security scanner<!--]--><!----></h3><p class=\"slp-text-body1\" data-v-64ad2128=\"\" data-v-c154cc84=\"\"><!--[-->AI-based review and SAST catch different classes of bugs and both have benefits. Here's how to decide which one runs where, and when your team needs both. <!--]--><!----></p></a>","link":"https://about.gitlab.com/blog/sast-vs-llm-security-scanner/","retrieved":1789578768328}]}